menu "Tab5 LASR experimental diagnostics"
    config LASR_CSI_DIAGNOSTIC
        bool "Read-only raw CSI laser candidate probe (UNVERIFIED)"
        default n
        help
            Off by default to preserve proven camera, color, and battery behavior.
            If explicitly enabled for an engineering build, captures the first
            frame as a reference and logs candidate flashes without creating
            shots, scores, or microSD writes. Requires physical SIRT and dark
            target calibration before any results may be trusted.
    config LASR_COMBINED_DIAGNOSTIC
        bool "Run isolated microSD smoke while raw CSI camera streams (review only)"
        default n
        depends on !LASR_SD_SMOKE_ON_BOOT
        help
            Never enabled in the normal camera image. Starts a separate
            no-format SD synthetic-session task after four physical CSI frames.
            Camera capture, preview, color and battery remain active. Laser
            candidate logs are UNSCORED and never persisted as live shots.
    config LASR_USB_PREVIEW_DIAGNOSTIC
        bool "USB JPEG preview engineering test (no Wi-Fi or SD probe)"
        default n
        depends on !LASR_COMBINED_DIAGNOSTIC && !LASR_SD_SMOKE_ON_BOOT
        help
            Dedicated recovery-guarded P4 USB Serial/JTAG camera preview.
            Uses JPEG hardware encoder on a bounded copy of display pixels,
            never retains V4L2 DMA frame memory. Streams real camera JPEG
            snapshots to a local browser via serial; no Wi-Fi, no scoring,
            no recording. Do not ship as production or modify the C6.

    config LASR_SD_SMOKE_ON_BOOT
        bool "One-time microSD write/readback test at boot (UNTESTED hardware)"
        default n
        help
            Explicit engineering opt-in only. After normal display and
            battery safety setup, mount SD without formatting, create one
            unique diagnostic file, verify contents, and unmount. Never run
            automatically on normal user firmware builds.
endmenu